# MyBrary

Personal library (서재) from anything you save: stick / classify / find. Live name **MyBrary**; repo folder may still be `myScrap`. Not a team knowledge base, not a recipe app, not a fridge or door metaphor. Product voice is **서재** (library). Light UI default is **Soft Deckle** (zero-hue archival paper, Newsreader + DM Sans, JetBrains Mono spine labels). Settings also ships **에디토리얼** / Minimal Editorial (white/ink, Space Grotesk + Inter, near-zero radius). See [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md).

Full IA: signed-out entry is the dedicated `/login` page (not a sheet) reusing `AuthSheet` via a `variant="page"` prop as an archival dossier (Google + email form + guest browse). Signed-in header is two nav tabs (나의 서재 `/`, 서재 통계 `/dashboard`) plus a Find icon (`/search`, also Cmd/Ctrl+K), a personal notices bell (onboarding prefs tip once; period and storage alerts; browse always shows period + capacity tips; panel overflow → `/notices`; blurred page scrim when open), and an account avatar (Google photo or ink User squircle) that opens `/settings`. Appearance mode lives only on `/settings` and cross-fades on change. Logout confirms via Protocol Stamp. Shelf layout is **Gallery** (default, 4:3 visual poster grid) or **Micro** (`mybrary.shelfLayout`, horizontal media rows) — the accordion/list layout is gone. Micro and Gallery cards open a right-hand `ShelfInspector` on desktop (≥960px) instead of navigating; mobile still navigates to `/scrap/:id`. The shelf workbench strip shows archival count plus a labeled Micro/Gallery segment. `/stick` renders the single-draft review as `Workbench` (3-step rail + CSS 3D cover), not a bare draft card. The type book carousel always shows its 8 fixed sections (전체/책갈피/메모/사진/영상/소리/링크/문서) and goes sticky-compact on desktop scroll. Settings offers language, theme palette (에디토리얼 / 소프트 데클), light·system·dark, reading scale, and storage reset (browse = local; signed-in = account; Middle+ sync stub only) — no Markdown export, no Look switcher and no AI-sensitivity slider. Centered dialogs use the **Protocol Stamp** shell (`.protocol-modal-*` / `AppDialog`), not browser `confirm` or pill auth buttons.

## Stack now

Vite 8 + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + Lucide. Firebase Hosting project `mybrary-snuu09` (`public: dist`, SPA rewrite). Supabase email/password, Google OAuth, plus 둘러보기 (anonymous Auth), `public.scraps`, private `scrap-media`. Claude classify is the Supabase Edge Function `analyze` (model **`claude-sonnet-4-5`**; assignment name `claude-sonnet-5` is not a current id). The client calls it with the user JWT. `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is a Supabase secret, never a Vite var. A missing function or key uses the MIME/URL fallback in [`src/lib/tagger.ts`](src/lib/tagger.ts) and the draft shows a fallback hint. Firebase Cloud Functions and the Netlify `/api/analyze` twin stay in the repo but need Blaze or a Netlify host; Spark Hosting does not run them.

Primary host is **Firebase Hosting**. Netlify files are a classify/dev twin, not a second product.

Shelf and search lists page in (24, then more). Sign media only for the visible window. `/api/og-image` requires the user JWT and does not follow a redirect off HTTPS.

**Plan tiers:** UI names Free / Middle / High (DB ids still `free` / `standard` / `premium` / `admin`). Limits in [`src/lib/plans.ts`](src/lib/plans.ts). `/upgrade` is the compare matrix. Bundle + compare/revert are High preview on that page until gated.

## Do not

- Revive `js/`, `css/`, `legal/*.html`, or a parallel static client
- Put Firebase Auth in the browser (Supabase stays Auth)
- Put `service_role` or `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` in Vite
- Dualize taggers: Claude in the function, MIME/URL fallback only in `src/lib/tagger.ts`
- Invent customers, testimonials, download counts, or a 사업자등록번호
- Use em-dashes in product copy
- Purple glass SaaS kits, Inter as the UI face under Warm·B, Notion sidebar. Strong `.liquid-glass` stays on button clusters (layout switcher, detail actions, settings tracks, and other control groups). Protocol Stamp modals use `.protocol-modal-btn-*`, not liquid glass. Glass look may lay a weaker blur on cards and bordered panels. Do not put that blur on the hero.
- Revive Jeju tangerine fridge enamel or Warm · B / 현무암 as Settings theme options (Soft Deckle is the light default; Editorial is the compare palette)
- Use door / fridge / “책장을 연다” copy; keep product language on **서재** / library

